    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A single trip and a habit",
     "texto": [
      "Идти (on foot) and ехать (by vehicle) describe a single trip in one direction: Я иду домой.",
      "Ходить and ездить express repeated trips or habits: Я хожу пешком в парк. Ездить refers to travelling by vehicle; ходить в спортзал usually means attending regularly and does not necessarily mean going on foot."
